JavaScript Functions
A function is a reusable block of code designed to perform a specific task. A function runs when it is called or invoked.
Function code ka ek aisa block hota hai jisme hum kisi particular kaam ka code likhte hain. Is code ko hum baar-baar reuse kar sakte hain.

Example:
Agar hume 10 baar "Hello" print karna hai, to 10 baar console.log() likhne ke bajay ek function bana sakte hain aur use 10 baar call kar sakte hain.

Basic Syntax
