Step 3: Function Parameters

A parameter is a variable/name written inside the parentheses of a function definition to receive a value.

Function definition me parentheses () ke andar jo variable/name likhte hain, use parameter kehte hain.

* Parameters are the names listed in the function definition.
* Arguments are the real values passed to, and received by the function.

Ab maan lo function ko bahar se value deni hai.

Example:
Syntax
